{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18157","headline":"梁国惠康公主挽歌二首 二 · 韩愈","name":"梁国惠康公主挽歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦地吹箫女，湘波鼓瑟妃。\n佩兰初应梦，奔月竟沦辉。\n夫族迎魂去，宫官会葬归。\n从今沁园草，无复更芳菲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}